      "created_at": "2025-11-11T11:33:34.769Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When a “website user” logins to erpnext, there’s a page with menus on the left.</p>\n<p>A “website user” is very limited access user.</p>\n<p>How to hide or disable the menu?</p>\n<p>Here’s the screenshot.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/f/ef31a17cc8bf5e8882b59adf45595d630a15ce40.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ef31a17cc8bf5e8882b59adf45595d630a15ce40\" title=\"Screenshot From 2025-11-11 19-08-09a\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/f/ef31a17cc8bf5e8882b59adf45595d630a15ce40_2_690x446.png\" alt=\"Screenshot From 2025-11-11 19-08-09a\" data-base62-sha1=\"y80rPNge2b7dhZvOWwa9rAZ5Rx6\" width=\"690\" height=\"446\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/f/ef31a17cc8bf5e8882b59adf45595d630a15ce40_2_690x446.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/f/ef31a17cc8bf5e8882b59adf45595d630a15ce40.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/f/ef31a17cc8bf5e8882b59adf45595d630a15ce40.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF3F3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot From 2025-11-11 19-08-09a</span><span class=\"informations\">890×576 36.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
