      "id": 486298,
      "username": "pvanthony",
      "name": "P V Anthony",
      "created_at": "2025-11-12T17:13:59.733Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you very much for helping.</p>\n<p>I login in as Administrator and found the portal setting.</p>\n<p>In the portal setting there is a check box called “Hide Standard Menu”.<br>\nI ticked and the whole left menu was gone.</p>\n<p>Thank you again for helping.</p>",
